    "bodyText": "What happens when you're neither red nor blue? What happens when you're in the middle and you could give zero shits about the extremist puppets spewing staged teleprompter lies on tv? What happens when you side with the Constitution and not the media? You weep. You sit on your couch disgusted and you weep. You do all you can to reverse the bipartisan brainwashing, you fight to make a difference not just for your generation but for every generation both in the past and the future and in turn you get handed a box of Dollar General aluminium and told to make you a little hat. Yeah...you should side with Hillary SHE HAS A VAGINA...never mind the fact that she has funded countries that enforce Sharia Law...never mind the body count, never mind Benghazi...SHE HAS A DRY, SHRIVELED VAGINA!!! Donald Trump? You should vote for him...sure he has zero political experience, sure he has filed bankruptcy 5 times...HE WILL BUILD US A WALL!!! Ya know, let's just vote for Sanders...so what if he is a Socialist...FREE SHITTTTT!!! Wake up assholes!!! While you're eating your GMO's, drooling over the mural of Hillary's snatch painted with the blood of our forefathers on the broad side of Trump's wall...the flesh of this country is rotting away. It's rotting and festering. What once was plump, and healthy is now a necrotic, pulpy pile. The extent of the damage has far surpassed the help of your free healthcare...in 2008 you people had a chance to turn this shit around and you allowed freedom to be shut out...God had mercy however and offered you another shot at redemption in 2012...and this time you not only shut the door, you proceeded to stand on his lawn, waving your made in China flag and voted the Socialist Obama in for a second term. God have mercy on our souls...but wait!!! Our only hope has a son? And he's running in 2016? Surely...surely after 8 years of the dry, prison rapes you endured would be enough. But it wasn't, it wasn't enough... Once again, you spit in the face of liberty and shit in its toilet with no intentions on even flushing. You screwed it's wife and didn't even have the common courtesy to turn their family photo around. You looked liberty right in its eye and raw dogged its wife. And what do we have to show for it? We have people with simple marijuana charges spending the rest of their lives in prison...we have people who performed a controlled burn on their farm rotting in prison...we have people waking up to a honey bun on their pillow for simply collecting rain water. You allow strangers to perform a rectal exam on your small child because they pose a terroristic threat...you allow the government to listen to every conversation you will ever have...you allow racial riots on your street and you dare not stand up for yourself because you're afraid to offend... It's funny, when you think about Hitler you immediately think of a murderous tyrant that killed millions...and you hate him. But you glorify the powers of this country when they're doing the same damn thing...except only this time, they're having us kill each other. Oh, and taxation is theft. #end\n-Amanda",
