    "bodyText": "    Ever feel trapped in your life? Your job doesn’t pay you enough. Your kids won’t shut up. You’re to broke to buy tampons. What do you do? Go do something stupid! Because how much worse can your life get? Its okay everyone has tried crack once.\n\nI’m a firm believer that sometimes making a bad decision is a good thing. Sometimes we have to blow off some steam. Go get drunk and wake up in bed with a hooker. Sell your car for a plane ticket to Vegas. But always be ready to come back to your normal life!\n\nI’m betting you have responsibility. You have “Tried a threesome” and blown off that feeling you suffocating. Now how do you go back to your boring ass life? You suck it up and be an adult. Sure some people can do meth and still feed there kids ramen but do you really want to go down this path? Stop mething around you know you don’t. You had your fun now go the fuck home and relieve the babysitter. Because you said you would be home at 2:00AM on Saturday, Its Monday moron.  Shes is 15 and in high school. You fucked up her weekend! ASSHOLE....\n\nNow that your home what do you do? You have to make your kids dinner, do laundry and call your boss because you missed worked Monday and didn’t call. Is it going to be easy? NO! But guess what thats why its life. At-least you aren’t going to do it again till next weekend! Just call you Ex and get him to watch your kids. Its okay he knows you go out every weekend and do coke with male strippers. By the way you won’t have to deal with your kids much longer... hes getting custody next week.\n\n-Drift",
